SUMMARY:SOCYPAA’s 20th Annual Campout
DESCRIPTION:Join SOCYPAA and co-host groups for a weekend of fellowship\, fun\, and outdoor activities at the 20th Annual Campout\, taking place June 5–7\, 2026\, at Pleasure Cove on Lake Berryessa in Napa\, California. \nThe event will feature activities including Campout Olympics\, Mafia\, and Love Thy Neighbor\, bringing together young people in recovery from across Northern California. \nEvent Details \n\nDates: June 5–7\, 2026\nLocation: Pleasure Cove\, Lake Berryessa\, 6100 Hwy 128\, Napa\, CA 94558\nRegistration: $40 beginning May 1; $45 at camp\n\nHosted by SOCYPAA with co-hosts including BUTTEYPAA\, MCYPAA\, MENDYPAA\, FCYPAA\, SCCYPAA\, ACYPAA\, EBYPAA\, and the Vacaville Young People’s Meeting. \nFor more information and registration\, visit socypaa.org.
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/socypaas-20th-annual-campout/
LOCATION:Pleasure Cove\, 6100 Hwy 128\, Lake Berryessa\, CA\, 95466\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-20th-Annual-campout.png
END:VEVENT
